I think you are complicating this too much creating a list of one, stream it and the stream concatenating it and then creating a list.

```suggestion
    static final List<ExpressionTranslator<?>> QUERY_TRANSLATORS = new ArrayList<>();
    static {
        QUERY_TRANSLATORS.add(new TrivialBinaryComparisons());
        QUERY_TRANSLATORS.addAll(ExpressionTranslators.QUERY_TRANSLATORS);
    }
```

